1
00:00:00,613 --> 00:00:03,083
♪ Then I'll look
from the door ♪

2
00:00:03,082 --> 00:00:06,222
♪ Of my heavenly home ♪

3
00:00:06,219 --> 00:00:08,619
♪ And pity the miner ♪

4
00:00:08,621 --> 00:00:11,961
♪ That mines my poor bones. ♪

5
00:00:13,893 --> 00:00:18,133
(Raj:)Okay. How 'bout
a little Miley Cyrus next?

6
00:00:18,131 --> 00:00:19,661
(Sheldon:)Who's he?

7
00:00:23,569 --> 00:00:25,739
(stammers)
Talk about wasted money.

8
00:00:25,738 --> 00:00:28,068
(Howard:)What about the late fees
on our credit card

9
00:00:28,074 --> 00:00:29,744
(Howard:)because somebody didn't pay
the bill on time?

10
00:00:29,742 --> 00:00:31,142
(Bernadette:)Well, maybe I would have paid it

11
00:00:31,144 --> 00:00:33,614
(Bernadette:)if I wasn't also doing
everything else around here.

12
00:00:33,613 --> 00:00:35,683
(Howard:)Oh, you're saying I don't do
anything around here.

13
00:00:37,583 --> 00:00:40,923
(Howard:)Look at my chore chart.

14
00:00:40,920 --> 00:00:44,460
(Leonard:)She made him a chore chart.
I see it.

15
00:00:44,457 --> 00:00:47,957
"Do the dishes."
There's a star right there.

16
00:00:47,960 --> 00:00:50,900
(Bernadette:)That was a pity star. Putting
water in the roasting pan

17
00:00:50,897 --> 00:00:53,867
(Bernadette:)and leaving it in the sink
is not doing the dishes.

18
00:00:53,866 --> 00:00:58,106
(Howard:)That pan had to soak
and you know it.

19
00:00:58,104 --> 00:01:00,234
(Bernadette:)Well, don't come crying to me

